OL,3,GNEWSAMan jailed for #370,000 cannabis
OL,4,Acultivation
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been jailed after police
OL,7,Ffound a major cannabis cultivation with
OL,8,Fa potential street value of more than
OL,9,F#370,000 in a house in Aberdeenshire.
OL,11,FThe discovery was made in Inverurie's
OL,12,FBirch Drive in February last year.
OL,14,FVo Quang, 43, was detained, and later
OL,15,Fadmitted producing cannabis.
OL,17,FAt Aberdeen Sheriff Court, he was
OL,18,Fjailed for 17 months.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
